# Cloudflare Workers static assets: response headers by path.
#
# no-transform stops Cloudflare from rewriting our HTML at the edge. Without it,
# Cloudflare injects its Web Analytics beacon (static.cloudflareinsights.com),
# a third-party script we did not ask for. Content blockers block that script,
# which shows up as "net::ERR_BLOCKED_BY_CLIENT" in the browser console, and the
# strict CSP planned for M12 would block it as well.

/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, no-transform

# Vite gives built files content hashes, so they can be cached for a year.
/assets/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable, no-transform
